          "Total dollar cost and total wall-clock hours for v4 were never disclosed (only the 3-week/126-session figure for v1 and the Oct 2025–May 2026 multi-console window).",
          "Whether the author's BIOS-thunk seeding (seeds/tomba_bios_thunks.txt) generalizes to games like BFM that use different PSY-Q library versions/call patterns.",
