          "curl + MediaWiki API for bot-blocked wikis: TCRF content via https://tcrf.net/api.php?action=parse&page=Brave_Fencer_Musashi&format=json&prop=wikitext ; Hidden Palace via https://hiddenpalace.org/w/index.php?title=PAGE&action=raw",
          "BizHawk (octoshock core) if reusing autosplitter/Archipelago addresses live: PS1 RAM address = octoshock.dll offset - 0x30DF90 (+0x80000000 for KSEG0 vaddr)",
